WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.190
April thirtieth.

2
00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.445
Midnight.

3
00:00:03.445 --> 00:00:04.866
And suddenly…

4
00:00:04.866 --> 00:00:05.884
May.

5
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.815
Slow it down.

6
00:00:07.815 --> 00:00:11.380
The date ring still has thirty-one positions.

7
00:00:11.842 --> 00:00:15.997
The ordinary driving finger advances it every night.

8
00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:21.066
But tonight, a calendar tooth meets an extra driving finger.

9
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.789
Stored energy is released.

10
00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:28.494
The extra finger pushes thirty to thirty-one…

11
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.659
then the ordinary finger finishes the jump.

12
00:00:32.659 --> 00:00:34.093
May first.

13
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:40.550
Carried by the date ring, this little wheel rolls around a stationary wheel.

14
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:49.853
One month later, it returns to the same place… facing a different way.

15
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.949
May thirtieth.

16
00:00:52.949 --> 00:00:56.605
This time, the extra finger finds a gap.

17
00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.309
One ordinary step.

18
00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.755
Thirty-one.

19
00:01:01.198 --> 00:01:03.967
Four months get that extra step.

20
00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:07.192
February needs your touch, once a year.

